{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    },
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-14",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0000",
      "source_sha256": "29e1c81f56dbfb09",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The repose of Saint John, the evangelist and apostle of Christ. In the peace of God. Amen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0001",
      "source_sha256": "7cebc5dddedd6ef8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The blessed John was in Ephesus with the brothers, rejoicing in the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0002",
      "source_sha256": "94cf9aa68dac6c30",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "On the Lord’s Day, all the brothers were gathered together."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0003",
      "source_sha256": "2bf1d6506461eb48",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "John began speaking to them, saying, “My brothers, my fellow heirs, and fellow sharers in Christ Jesus our Lord, understand that the Lord has given you power through him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0004",
      "source_sha256": "405e4ba48bc752fb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How many miracles, wonders, and spiritual gifts"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0005",
      "source_sha256": "ac0a2de4ae48f169",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he has brought about for you! And you know the teachings, the works of skill, the comforts, the service, the favors, the gifts, and all the other things that you have seen with your own eyes,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0006",
      "source_sha256": "1fa1117e3db6b5dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "which are given to you through our master."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0007",
      "source_sha256": "c7f6cbad84bd18cf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He was not appearing to you through bodily eyes, nor were you hearing him through bodily ears. Rather, he reveals himself to you through the uprightness of your heart, in a vision, in holy deeds."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0008",
      "source_sha256": "8c8cb3ad97bc6cff",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "So be firmly established in him, remembering him at all times, and remembering also the mystery and the fellowship that came to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "9cc3b734c33d7d9d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Our Lord brought them to fulfillment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0010",
      "source_sha256": "a6cc99a8d6da0647",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now, brothers, he appeals to you through him and urges you, wanting you to stop wishing to grieve him, insult him, or plot against him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0011",
      "source_sha256": "67eaa3df5590ec33",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For he knows the insult that comes from you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0012",
      "source_sha256": "7d1b72cb37d3d13c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He also understands the humiliation, and he knows the plotting and the punishment with which you punish him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0013",
      "source_sha256": "7a9a77978af5cfdd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "When you obey his holy commandments, he will have mercy on you too."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0014",
      "source_sha256": "f1e53569294da0d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Do not cause the good God to grieve because of you: the merciful and compassionate one, the undefiled, the tireless, the incomprehensible, the one who alone is unique, the unchanging, the guileless, the one without anger, the name above every name that can be conceived."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0015",
      "source_sha256": "4f8b88396a85b22a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Let him be glad with you as you conduct yourselves well for him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0016",
      "source_sha256": "d175e86a8ccb5e9c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Let him rejoice with you as you live in gladness and moderation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0017",
      "source_sha256": "184de397b16baba1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Let him find rest in you as you conduct yourselves with dignity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0018",
      "source_sha256": "36612fb4571bfdb3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let him be free from worry as you live in self-control."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0019",
      "source_sha256": "a0918f57027b5830",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let him rejoice as you share in the good things and the promises."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0020",
      "source_sha256": "240053587036015f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let him delight as you love him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0021",
      "source_sha256": "ba364b5c7e9cb01b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let him smile as you remain sober."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0022",
      "source_sha256": "f00bf7fdeff805ab",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "These things, then, my brothers, I say to you because I am eager to go forward with the work he has set before me, whose completion will come to me through the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0023",
      "source_sha256": "d59cf83adc2a68d5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For what other word shall I say to you, when you have the pledge of your God?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0024",
      "source_sha256": "a1a5060a1307ed53",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "You have the pledge of his kingdom."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0025",
      "source_sha256": "e595b2793a923b6e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You have his presence, which cannot be rejected."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0026",
      "source_sha256": "eb6874615d1689df",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If you do not sin from now on, then he will forgive you for what you did in ignorance."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0027",
      "source_sha256": "e6eefab23a6f6cdd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But if, after coming to know him, you continue persisting in these same deeds, the former deeds will be counted against you, and you will be handed over to the fire.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0028",
      "source_sha256": "a4660b492202c9ac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After saying these things, he prayed, saying, “Jesus, you who wove your crown, this crown that is in your own weaving,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0029",
      "source_sha256": "6a4b01e5cd982a14",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O you who created your crown of all the saints, and these many [?], which he transformed among people—your flower, which never withers,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0030",
      "source_sha256": "73408764a900128a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O you who sowed his words within us,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0031",
      "source_sha256": "099a7797f7126dd0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O you who alone care for his servants,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0032",
      "source_sha256": "067bfc08c70f2b74",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O physician of our body, who heals them all freely!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0033",
      "source_sha256": "80965b66eb91be43",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O you alone who do good to us!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0034",
      "source_sha256": "77baf91dd92b331f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O you in whom no arrogance is hidden!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0035",
      "source_sha256": "f3ffebd50bbb379b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O you alone who are merciful and love every human being!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0036",
      "source_sha256": "69064bb3f571a4e1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O you alone who are the Savior and the righteous one, who are everywhere, who have existed forever, God, Jesus Christ!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0037",
      "source_sha256": "bff8f7ff53d457d3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You shelter everyone who hopes in you with your gifts and your acts of mercy, knowing every scheme and every malicious attack of the enemy who opposes us at all times."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0038",
      "source_sha256": "9ce8fdffd2688064",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After Saint John the Evangelist had said these things, he took bread and gave thanks in this way, saying, “What other blessing, or what other expression of the word, or what other thanksgiving shall we name over this bread that we break, except you alone, Lord Jesus Christ?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0039",
      "source_sha256": "1f21581410e78d1a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "We give you glory, Lord Jesus Christ, whose name was revealed through the Father."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0040",
      "source_sha256": "e7b8a5b47b27057c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We glorify your entrance through the door."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0041",
      "source_sha256": "7d7d3f25105118d8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We glorify your holy resurrection from the dead, which we were taught through you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0042",
      "source_sha256": "d812d50e002e329c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We glorify you, the way."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0043",
      "source_sha256": "1889e003ebf62a88",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We glorify you, the seed, the Word, the salt, the true stone, the holy treasure, the plow, the net, the greatness, the one who was called ‘Son of Man’ for our sake, so that he might save the human race."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0044",
      "source_sha256": "f33747b00997a857",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We glorify you, the truth, the rest, the glory, the power, the commandment, the boldness, the freedom, our refuge.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0045",
      "source_sha256": "494d1052e17468fa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "For you are the Lord, the root of immortality, the spring of incorruptibility, and the foundation of the ages."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0046",
      "source_sha256": "fc93c3251465d80c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Your name has been pronounced over all these things, so that we too may call upon you through them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0047",
      "source_sha256": "7486352200ccea60",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "For we know your invisible greatness, which is not revealed to us now."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0048",
      "source_sha256": "a61c7fd072414c63",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "When you purify us, then we will see you in the very body that you made new in old age."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0049",
      "source_sha256": "62ee5b4e0229044d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "And when he broke the bread, he prayed over each of the brothers, so that they might be worthy of the Lord’s grace."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0050",
      "source_sha256": "69dedfca51f24ff7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise, Saint John himself, when he had tasted the bread,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0051",
      "source_sha256": "6464628bae913473",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "John the Theologian spoke in this way, saying, “Let me too have a share with you in peace, my beloved ones.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0052",
      "source_sha256": "0c52d5700e2ff497",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then he said to Byrrhus, “Take two brothers with you, carrying baskets and shovels, and follow me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0053",
      "source_sha256": "0f2b6a81e09b74d5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Byrrhus did not neglect this at all, but did what he had been commanded by Saint John the Theologian, the servant of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0054",
      "source_sha256": "c038f45eb53b8daf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the blessed John came out of his house, he walked outside the city gate, having told most of the crowd following him to go away and leave him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0055",
      "source_sha256": "2345f4359cf009a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When he reached a burial place belonging to one of the brothers, he said to the young men, “Dig in this place, my children.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0056",
      "source_sha256": "bc20c1189718a9e8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They dug down."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0057",
      "source_sha256": "e649d32d0e74babd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "John the Theologian instructed them, “Dig down well.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0058",
      "source_sha256": "2135c20dc6f78c70",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he said, “Go deeper.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0059",
      "source_sha256": "0ee2e36c88dbae5e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "While they were digging deeper,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0060",
      "source_sha256": "8f56e61195a5996e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he spoke with them about the word and encouraged them, building them up, preparing them, and persuading them to enter the kingdom of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0061",
      "source_sha256": "9d7823143efa9acc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he prayed over each one of them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0062",
      "source_sha256": "43f8bc3fa988b31a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the young men had finished deepening the place where they were digging, having prepared it well according to his wishes,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0063",
      "source_sha256": "a8d45e9b78b0a755",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And we understood nothing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0064",
      "source_sha256": "0f963c25c27e516a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then he stripped off the clothes he was wearing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0065",
      "source_sha256": "89b785538a997747",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He threw them down into the place that had been dug out, a broad space."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0066",
      "source_sha256": "c56f4393f70d5bbb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He stood wearing only a robe, which had [?] on both sides."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0067",
      "source_sha256": "4a2150591bde4f5d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he stretched out his hands and prayed in this way, saying, “God, who chose me for himself to be an apostle to the nations, you sent me out into the inhabited world."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0068",
      "source_sha256": "d479b02418816f1b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who revealed himself to the prophets and his apostles."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0069",
      "source_sha256": "e8283e400fbb0e16",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who has never stopped doing good since the foundation of the world, saving all who have no strength."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0070",
      "source_sha256": "d7522a697e7ed290",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who made himself known through every rational human being and every living creature, as they are cared for through his providence."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0071",
      "source_sha256": "60f7f04ea533da46",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who made our soul tame and quieted it when it was savage and wild."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0072",
      "source_sha256": "f30f325aaa29af70",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who gave it to himself as it laughed at his enemies."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0073",
      "source_sha256": "9090ec7f9f630bbb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who uncovered it for himself when it was dead, and established a law for it when it was sinking in the mire of lawlessness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0074",
      "source_sha256": "8cbbf4c33cb7df2d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "The one who made her overcome her enemies when she fled to him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0075",
      "source_sha256": "74d1f82fb4e508fb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who gave it his hand and saved it from the underworld."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0076",
      "source_sha256": "e6cdea46d5b9f03e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who did not allow it to live according to the ways of the world."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0077",
      "source_sha256": "ee6bc094e854d687",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who taught it to overcome its enemies."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0078",
      "source_sha256": "319e0cbf3de415ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The one who made the knowledge of him shine everywhere."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0079",
      "source_sha256": "a9a525464c204793",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Son of God, the Savior, the Lord, the order of those in the air."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0080",
      "source_sha256": "5b33accf5ef751ba",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The guardian of those on the earth, the grace and joy of those who belong to him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0081",
      "source_sha256": "5b649a8fc3f90473",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Receive the soul of John, who belongs to you, the soul you made worthy of being known by you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0082",
      "source_sha256": "4ac1cedb25cbfd30",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For you are the one who has protected me until now, and I have never been defiled with a woman."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0083",
      "source_sha256": "71153004f7eb44e8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You revealed yourself to me when I wanted to marry in my youth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0084",
      "source_sha256": "bbdda81e5f5bc0f0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And you said to me, ‘John, I need you.’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0085",
      "source_sha256": "e0fcd58865aee158",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You acted first."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0086",
      "source_sha256": "8ab572c1aa6bdb05",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You dealt with my body through a period of physical illness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0087",
      "source_sha256": "bcbcfdca3a68350f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You are the one who hindered me many times when I wanted to marry."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0088",
      "source_sha256": "56e6c23c0609cd9c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Afterward, you spoke with me at the third hour of the day by the sea, saying, ‘John, if you did not belong to me, I would have left you alone, and you would have married and become blind in both eyes, and remained in grief, pleading with me.’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0089",
      "source_sha256": "e48d3d0a5c1bb4cf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who opened my heart in my third year."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0090",
      "source_sha256": "fab21fd4f726a836",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You granted me other eyes, which are not visible."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0091",
      "source_sha256": "57566f5d5b511c57",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who made anger and desire for women repulsive to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0092",
      "source_sha256": "565cfba012b09c62",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who saved me from the illusions of the present age, preserving me for everlasting life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0093",
      "source_sha256": "af5b626ced656e83",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who made me a stranger to the evil madness that exists in the flesh, making me turn away from bitter death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0094",
      "source_sha256": "8a3d7efdcb312d04",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "The one who saved me from the second death, which is the fiery Gehenna, as you made me stand in holiness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0095",
      "source_sha256": "0a2cf596baeceaa0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who silenced the hidden sickness of my soul."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0096",
      "source_sha256": "9a00892ecd3348d3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And you removed the secret act and the visible deed that is performed in the body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0097",
      "source_sha256": "2e7870679c910a28",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who saved me and cast out of me what troubled me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0098",
      "source_sha256": "a77a16aaa87cff2a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who prepared my journey to him to be holy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0099",
      "source_sha256": "35e667803d8ed8ea",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who kept my thoughts toward him undefiled."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0100",
      "source_sha256": "1dfd4690c02d6e9b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who granted me his undivided faith."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0101",
      "source_sha256": "698f9fa0a41d2cad",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who made my thoughts and my plans grow more abundant toward him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0102",
      "source_sha256": "d4599fbd24b3eff4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He who gives to each person according to their deeds. He who put it into my soul not to keep anything for myself except you alone, Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0103",
      "source_sha256": "6e7ca2ebf25bef24",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For what will I find that is more excellent and purer than you?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0104",
      "source_sha256": "ddf9509e3cdc76bf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But now I have found you, and I have completed the task you entrusted to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0105",
      "source_sha256": "d329e021bd7a82b5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Therefore, make me worthy for you to give me rest in your holy resting place, and grant me the perfection that is in you, which is sinlessness, together with salvation that cannot be expressed, searched out, or grasped, as I come to you, my Lord Jesus Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0106",
      "source_sha256": "19321adb2de0581e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let the fire be stilled, and let the darkness withdraw. Let chaos become weak, and let the fiery flame become powerless. Let Gehenna be extinguished, and let the holy angels follow me. Let the demons be afraid, and let the rulers be crushed. Let the powers of darkness withdraw and fall down, and let the places on the right stand firm."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0107",
      "source_sha256": "43572f456f535ed4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let the devil be put to shame, and let Satan be mocked."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0108",
      "source_sha256": "8f6504d4dc7d6dc0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let his anger be extinguished, and let his madness be stilled."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0109",
      "source_sha256": "5968dc02dbd3965a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let his honor be put to shame, and let his wrath be crushed. Let his children be dragged down, and let their entire root be pulled out."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0110",
      "source_sha256": "15b8f0b2fe1a31a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Give me the authority to walk and to complete my journey without hardship or turmoil, as I come to you, my Lord, so that I may receive in full measure the good things of those who have lived."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0111",
      "source_sha256": "062d85789f91998b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "When John the Theologian had said these things, he looked toward the east, giving glory to God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0112",
      "source_sha256": "cf5de781f5998a02",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He stretched out his hands again and prayed, saying, “You are with me, my Lord Jesus Christ.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0113",
      "source_sha256": "bd4c5da2caadf341",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And immediately he threw himself down into the pit they had dug, where his clothes were spread out."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0114",
      "source_sha256": "da404012d5bae67c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when he had said to them, “Peace and grace,” he dismissed the brothers. They went away and came out the next day."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0115",
      "source_sha256": "b620d0c6c1a11541",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They did not find him, but they found his sandal and fresh earth in the place into which he had gone down."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0116",
      "source_sha256": "6a30fd54b3f2eda3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 3,
      "text": "Then they remembered the words that the Lord had spoken to Peter: “If I want him to remain until I come, who are you? You, follow me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0117",
      "source_sha256": "eb232788178d078b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 3,
      "text": "And they gave glory to the Lord Jesus Christ for the miracle that had happened to the blessed apostle and evangelist, the theologian and holy virgin, Saint John, the beloved of Christ Jesus, our Lord, our God, and our Savior."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/dormition_john#CopScr.dormition-john.000.0118",
      "source_sha256": "37e455c7976f9e51",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 3,
      "text": "With him, all glory belongs to the Father and the Holy Spirit, who gives life to all and is of the same essence, now and at all times, forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
